{"id": "x0154", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I think the best way to become more successful is to be surrounded by people who are more successful than you. And if they're not, then it's probably because they' re not very good at what they do or they don't care about being successful. So surround yourself with people who are better than you and learn from them.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 16, "carrier_ended": null}
