{"id": "x0210", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "It's changed a lot since the early days of gaming. We've seen massive improvements in technology, graphics, and gameplay experiences. Now we have immersive virtual reality games and online communities that connect players worldwide. The industry has also expanded to include mobile gaming, esports, and even interactive story telling.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0218", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The efficient market hypothesis is a theory that stock prices reflect all available information at any given time. So it means that investors can' t consistently outper form the market because they don't have access to any extra information that would let them make better decisions than other people. In short, it says markets are pretty smart and usually move based on what everyone already knows.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0226", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Queen's coffin was decorated with a small, gold crown called the Sovereign's Diadem. This crown has been worn by British monarchs at coronations for over 300 years. It symbol izes her role as head of state and represents the long line of British kings and queens who have re ign before her.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
